          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni hubate waan jed'e, Ee, ka gurba kiyya! Bineensa alati isa nyaate, gurba kiyya Yusufu ya bineensi gargari ch'ire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni laalefate woya ufii tarsaase ch'arqi naqate guyya heddu ilma isati bohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijoolleeni isaa, Iraa hafi jetteeni, ammo inni iraa hafu dide waan jed'e, Haga due boola seenuti anini isaa inuma boha. Duuba boha lakisu dide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
