          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga inni akasuma bohu, worri gosa Midiani kaani Yusufu Misiri keesati Potifati gurgurate. Potifaani suni huji Farao keesa jira, askartiini mana Farao eeddu ch'ufti isa jala jirti.",
          "type": "text",
